  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flooding emergency in Urab&#xe1;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the early warnings issued by the mayor&apos;s office and the local humanitarian coordination body ELC, and with additional information sourced through the accompaniment provided by the Catholic Church to the affected communities in San Juan (Urab&#xe1;), needs were identified in food security, WASH, health, temporary accommodation, and early recovery. This project prioritises food security, WASH and NIFs by providing 170 food kits, 170 hygiene kits and 170 NFI kits to 170 vulnerable households, who have not received any aid so far.</narrative>
  </description>
